    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are two non-zero&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>n</mi></math> matrices such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then",
