  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Also,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
